149
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:39,635
which I mentioned before

150
00:05:39,635 --> 00:05:42,650
requires some special
considerations.

151
00:05:42,650 --> 00:05:46,760
If you are using a singly
linked list and you're

152
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:48,230
removing elements as one of

153
00:05:48,230 --> 00:05:50,810
the steps inside
