00:06:00,075 --> 00:06:02,590
There's a sample
that's linked here

159
00:06:02,590 --> 00:06:04,270
and there's also a
queue.h that I'm

160
00:06:04,270 --> 00:06:06,640
mentioning that show you how to

161
00:06:06,640 --> 00:06:09,820
use a queue.h in an example.

162
00:06:09,820 --> 00:06:13,810
You can see a working
example where in this case

